# Cycle-176e (2026-05-10): use .autodev/* (not .autodev/) so the
# !.autodev/skills/ exception below actually re-includes the skill
# files. Git won't traverse into an excluded directory, so the
# bare `.autodev/` blanket form blocks re-inclusion regardless of
# `!` ancestor exceptions — `.autodev/*` is needed for the
# exception to bite.
.autodev/*
!.autodev/skills/
!.autodev/skills/**
