# the !.autodev/skills/ exceptions earlier in this file, which made
# git ignore the skill files anyway. Removed; the earlier
# `.autodev/*` + `!.autodev/skills/**` block (lines ~179-181) is the
# single source of truth.
!.autodev/skills/
